{title: 270 - O Holy Dove of God Descending}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Holy Spirit}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[C]O holy [Bdim]Dove of [Am]Goddescending,
[C/E]You [Bdim]are the [Am]love that knows [G7/F]no ending.
[G7/F]All of our [F/C]shattered [Dm]dreams You're [C]mending:
[C]Spirit, now live in me.

Verse 2:
[C]O holy [Bdim]Wind of [Am]God now [C]blowing,
[C/E]You [Bdim]are the [Am]seed that God [G7/F]us sowing.
[G7/F]You are the [F/C]life that [Dm]starts us [C]growing:
[C]Spirit, now live in me.

Verse 3:
[C]O holy [Bdim]Rain of [Am]God now [C]falling,
[C/E]You [Bdim]make the [Am]Word of God [G7/F]enthralling,
[G7/F]You are that [F/C]inner [Dm]voice now [C]calling:
[C]Spirit, now live in me.

Verse 4:
[C]O holy [Bdim]Flame of [Am]God now [C]burning,
[C/E]You [Bdim]are the [F]power [Am]of Christ [G7/F]returning.
[G7/F]You are the [F/C]answer [Dm]to our [C]yearning:
[C]Spirit, now live in me.
